oir 2 low
// Low golden of coro/coro-start-continuation.oir (V4).
// C-2: continuation 0 restores the receiver, the language arguments and the input packet, in order.
// Continuation 0 is unchanged; the closes of run and main settle their duties and deliver (D18).
module coro_start_continuation
entry @main
object Box {
    field n: int
}
scope S0 action in @Box.new
scope S1 action in @Box.get
scope S2 action in @run
scope S3 action in @main
